      "title": "Career Development",
      "description": "Career Development | Briar Cliff University Warning! Your browser is extremely outdated and not web standards compliant. Your browsing experience would greatly improve by upgrading to a modern browser . Alumni Athletics Cliff Shop Donate Make a Payment Request Info Apply Search find something... Search Briar Cliff University. Link to homepage About Our Story Our Story Mission, Vision, and Values Fast Facts History Accreditation and Policies Accreditation and Policies Consumer Information Our Employees Our Employees Charger STABLE Employee Portal Employee Benefits Careers Emeriti Professors Employee Directory Our Leadership Our Leadership Board of Trustees Cabinet Our Campus Our Campus Buildings and Facilities Buildings and Facilities Residence Halls Athletic Facilities Academic Buildings Student Support Buildings Clinics on The Cliff Outdoor Spaces Sioux City Location Roth Cliff Shop Host Your Event Bishop Mueller Library Having trouble locating some information about us? We are here to help. Contact Us Future Chargers Admissions Admissions Meet The Team Virtual Tour Explore Programs Registration Registration Transcripts Transfer Tuition & Aid Tuition & Aid Scholarships & Grants Cost of Attendance Cost of Attendance Understanding Your Cost of Attendance Financial Aid Financial Aid Financial Aid Forms Consumer Information Student Account Services Partner Tuition Advantage Residence Life Residence Life Explore Residence Halls Dining Apply for Housing Visits are the best way to understand the Briar Cliff difference and get answers. Schedule a Visit Current Chargers Student Life Student Life BCYou Student Portal Brightspace Charger STABLE Make a Payment Upcoming Events Upcoming Events Academic Events Athletics Events Music & Fine Arts Events Graduation Homecoming Get Involved Get Involved Student Organizations Student Organizations Book Club Carver Molecular Biology Teaching Lab Research Team Catholic Daughters C.H.O.I.C.E.S Cliff Singers Cliff Network Education Club Enactus Health and Science Club History Club Honors Program Jazz Ensemble Liturgical Ministers Knights of San Damiano Men and Women of Color Nursing Student Association Social Work Club S.O.U.R.C.E Spanish-International Club Student Government Theatre Club Student Athlete Association Student Support Services Student Support Services Academic Advising Academic Peer Mentors Bishop Mueller Library Briar Grill Campus Security CARE Team Career Development Center for Interprofessional Education, Practice & Scholarship Charged Food & Brew Charger Closet Clausen Art Gallery Clifftop Eats Compass Counseling Center Facilities IT Help Center Learning Communities Mailroom Ministry on Campus Multicultural Center Peer Advising Leaders The POD Print Shop Registrar Roth Cliff Shop Student Accessibility Student Account Services Student Athlete Services Financial Aid Student Health TRIO Student Support Services TRIO Talent Search Walsh Fitness Center Writing & Translation Center Student Activities Student Activities Athletics House System Blue Crew Intramurals Music and Fine Arts Volunteer Opportunities Work-Study Human Subjects Research Project Academics Academics Undergraduate Programs Master Programs Doctorate Programs Professional Programs Cliff Academy Programs Cliff Academy Programs Online Courses Courses On-Demand Ask a question or let us help you navigate our site. Your experience is our top priority. Contact Us Family and Friends Alumni and Donors Alumni and Donors Ways to Give Foundations for the Future Impact Opportunities Impact Opportunities Campus Beautification Create Your Impact Alumni Support Charger Fans Charger Fans Upcoming Events Athletic Calendar Roth Cliff Shop Host Your Event Parents Parents Make a Payment News Cliff Stories You are a vital part of our Cliff community. Let us help provide the support you need. Contact Us Make A Payment Donate Find a Degree Apply Schedule a Visit Request Information Alumni Cliff Shop Facebook Instagram Twitter Youtube find something... Search Close Request Info Apply Contact Visit Current Chargers Student Life Upcoming Events Get Involved Student Organizations Student Support Services Academic Advising Academic Peer Mentors Bishop Mueller Library Briar Grill Campus Security CARE Team Career Development Center for Interprofessional Education, Practice & Scholarship Charged Food & Brew Charger Closet Clausen Art Gallery Clifftop Eats Compass Counseling Center Facilities IT Help Center Learning Communities Mailroom Ministry on Campus Multicultural Center Peer Advising Leaders The POD Print Shop Registrar Roth Cliff Shop Student Accessibility Student Account Services Student Athlete Services Financial Aid Student Health TRIO Student Support Services TRIO Talent Search Walsh Fitness Center Writing & Translation Center Student Activities Academics Career Development The Career Development is devoted to connecting BCU students to the outside world once they graduate. The Career Development Office works with students, alumni, and employers to offer the best opportunities after graduation. Student Resources The goal of the Career Development Office is to assist students with gaining the necessary skills to launch their dream careers in their chosen major or field. The Career Development office provides assistance with skills and services like: Exploring majors and careers Developing and critiquing resumes/cover letters Internship opportunities and connections Exploring options for graduate school Career search Practicing interview skills We also help to facilitate and coordinate work-study , and many internship opportunities for students on campus. View All Postings Alumni Resources Just because you have graduated doesn't mean you wont receive our support. We are happy to provide career development services to our alumni to help them land their next position and make Cliff community connections. Exploring career and further education options Developing resumes/cover letters Searching for a new job Practicing interview skills View All Postings Local Employers We work closely with employers, local and national, to ensure our students are taking advantage of every opportunity possible. We encourage employers to post job opportunities on Handshake . This is platform that we send all BCU students and alumni to to look for work-study, internships, and job postings. Regular Hours Monday - Friday 8:00 AM - 4:30 PM *Regular hours may vary during summer break, holiday breaks, or for special events on campus.* Are you ready to jump start your career? Create an account and view all posting and apply for the best opportunity that meeting your needs. To ask a question or schedule an appointment for assistance reach out to the Career Development today. View Available Positions Contact Us Apply Request Information Schedule a Visit Find a Degree Contact 3303 Rebecca Street Sioux City, Iowa 51104 (712) 279-5200 Facebook Instagram Twitter Youtube Careers BCYou Portal Employee Directory Campus Map Privacy Policy Contact Security © 2026 Briar Cliff University. All Rights Reserved | Privacy Policy & Legal Information | Web design by Blue Compass Website funded in part by the Department of Education"
